<title>INDIA: India Grasim 1996/97 net seen down.</title>
<headline>India Grasim 1996/97 net seen down.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Net profit of diversified firm Grasim Industries Ltd is likely to decline 9.74 percent to 2.99 billion rupees in the year ended March 31, 1997, a Reuter poll of 28 leading securities and brokerage firms said.</p>
<p>Projections ranged from 2.54 billion rupees to 4.48 billion</p>
<p>rupees against 3.32 billion rupees in the year-ago period.</p>
<p>.</p>
<p>GRASIM IND  ----PAT seen down 9.74%, sales off 1.63%</p>
<p>		     Net profit   1995/96    Net sales   1995/96</p>
<p>				(in million rupees)</p>
<p>Average		2,994.77   3,318.00   31,472.63   31,993.10</p>
<p>High		   4,481.30		  37,000.00</p>
<p>Low		    2,541.00		  26,095.10</p>
<p>--Bombay newsroom +91-22-265-9000</p>
